1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,300
At twilight, Lumi spotted a lonely little light
trembling in the grass.

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:11,000
LUMI: Hey, little glow. Why are you all alone?

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,800
FIREFLY: I lost my family. My light is too tiny!

4
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:23,800
Lumi folded a broad leaf around a shining drop of dew,
making a tiny lantern.

5
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:29,500
LUMI: We'll follow the creek. Stay close to my lantern!

6
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:36,500
They hopped from stone to stone while the water
painted silver stars.

7
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:41,500
FIREFLY: That old willow! My family gathers there!

8
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:47,000
LUMI: Then let's make the darkest path sparkle!

9
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:54,000
One firefly answered, then ten, then a thousand tiny lights
filled the clearing.

10
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000
FIREFLY: You found them! Thank you, Lumi!

11
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
LUMI: Anytime, friend.
